WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.455
Linden & Hale is a fictional estate-planning and probate practice.

2
00:00:03.455 --> 00:00:08.908
It is built for two kinds of visitor: people planning ahead, and people dealing with a death.

3
00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:16.122
Pick a life moment and the page shows the matching path.

4
00:00:16.122 --> 00:00:49.201
Legal terms explain themselves where they appear.

5
00:00:49.201 --> 00:00:54.259
The four steps of working together, in plain language.

6
00:00:54.259 --> 00:01:00.945
A reading-comfort control for larger text and higher contrast.

7
00:01:00.945 --> 00:01:08.876
A first-meeting pack visitors can print or save.
